  }
 ],
 "react": [
  {
   "component": "RunCompare",
   "exported": true,
   "props": [
    {
     "name": "title",
     "type": "string",
     "optional": true,
     "description": "The heading – e.g. the task both runs did"
    },
    {
     "name": "view",
     "type": "RunCompareView",
     "optional": true,
     "description": "The open tab. Controlled when defined; otherwise the component keeps it, starting from `defaultView`"
    },
    {
     "name": "defaultView",
     "type": "RunCompareView",
     "optional": true,
     "description": "The tab open at first when `view` isn't controlled"
    },
    {
     "name": "onViewChange",
     "type": "(view: RunCompareView) => void",
     "optional": true,
     "description": "Called with the tab the user picked, controlled or not"
    },
    {
     "name": "onPick",
     "type": "(pick: RunComparePick) => void",
     "optional": true,
     "description": "Shows \"Use this\" on each finished run"
    }
   ],
   "hides": [
    "heading",
    "view",
    "canPick"
   ],
   "events": {
    "tc-view-change": null,
    "tc-pick": "onPick"
   }
  }
 ],
 "changelog": [
  "`tc-run-compare` – two runs or prompt versions side by side: outputs and prompts word-diffed with inline-diff's Myers diff, steps aligned and marked Added / Dropped / Changed, cost, time and tokens marked better or worse. Tabs; `tc-view-change`, `tc-pick`."
 ],
